OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns raised over impact of
OL,4,Aquad bikes on wildlife
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised over the
OL,7,Fimpact of quad bike riders on wildlife
OL,8,Fin a woodland area near Muff, County
OL,9,FDonegal in the Republic of Ireland.
OL,11,FMargaret Peoples, who is from
OL,12,FCarnamoyle, said people riding quad
OL,13,Fbikes in Lisnagra Woods have been
OL,14,Fvisiting the area throughout the
OL,15,Fsummer.
OL,17,FPeoples said the quad bikes are causing
OL,18,Fsignificant damage to the woodland,
OL,19,Fmaking the area difficult for families
OL,20,Fand dog walkers to use, while also
OL,21,Fcutting up the forest floor, which is
OL,22,Fimpacting plants and wildlife.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
