OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns raised over impact of
OL,4,Aquad bikes on wildlife
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said the noise and damage caused by
OL,7,Fthe heavy vehicles are particularly
OL,8,Fconcerning for a colony of red
OL,9,Fsquirrels, at a time when they are
OL,10,Fgathering and storing food ahead of
OL,11,Fwinter.
